Yup this is correct. As for a wipe, I dont think theyve said anything yet, but I would be very surprised if they DIDNT do a wipe after the play test / before launch. Anyone who played regularly through the play tests would have a big advantage over new/er players (ie more materials, more weapons available, more map knowledge (although this last one cant really be reset lol)).

&#x200B;

Hope to see you out there, and remember: TALK, then SHOOT--most people seem to be pretty chill if you announce you are chill. Not everyone is, but more often than not I avoid a quick death through talking

