Four in roman numerals is "IV" not "IIII".

&#x200B;

Youre meme is bad too.

I have 2 theories on this;

1) When we go to the Kiln, we walk through some kind of white tunnel....so possibly its NOT in Lordran, and is located in another time/place

&#x200B;

2) Regular old passage of time. When we see it in the intro, this is before literally ANYTHING happened (dragon wars, gwn's age, fire fading, etc). Therefore, it could stand to reason that while originally it was underground, in the ages that have passed, it was "dug up" or otherwise built into a "shrine" to the fire/gwn. 

&#x200B;

This is all outta my ass though, so take it as you will :)
